    "name": "BrewLite API",
    "description": "API tests for the implemented BrewLite backend endpoints.\n\nRun order: Products -> Orders. The collection stores productId and orderId from responses, but ships with seed defaults so individual folders can run on their own.\n\nPrerequisites:\n- PostgreSQL running and seeded (`backend/prisma/seed.mjs`)\n- Backend running on http://localhost:8000\n\nSelect the `BrewLite Local` environment (or keep the collection baseUrl variable).",
